«

@@ Temporary workaround for issue 1648.

@@ Filter a list according to a predicate
@@ ( inputList predicate -- outputList )
«
	{}
     	→ inputList predicate outputList
	«
		@@ Keep the input list on the stack.
		inputlist

		@@ Iterate over the input list.
		While
			@@ Still work to be done?
			Duplicate Size 0 >
		Repeat
			@@ Transform the head of the input list.
			Duplicate
			Head
			
		    	If
				Duplicate predicate
			Then
				@@ Save the wanted value value.
			   	outputList
				Swap 1 ToList
				Add
				'outputList' Store
			Else
				Drop
			End

			@@ Move on to the tail of the input list.
			Tail
		End

		@@ Remove the now empty input list.
		Drop
		@@ That's what we want.
		outputList
	»
»
ConstantFilter Store


@@ Map a transformation over a list.
@@ ( inputList tranformation -- outputList )
«
	{}
     	→ inputList transformation outputList
	«
		@@ Keep the input list on the stack.
		inputlist

		@@ Iterate over the input list.
		While
			@@ Still work to be done?
			Duplicate Size 0 >
		Repeat
			@@ Transform the head of the input list.
			Duplicate
			Head
			transformation

			@@ Save the transformed value.
			outputList
			Swap 1 ToList
			Add
			'outputList' Store

			@@ Move on to the tail of the input list.
			Tail
		End

		@@ Remove the now empty input list.
		Drop
		@@ That's what we want.
		outputList
	»
»
ConstantMap Store


»
